title: Nutanix Prism: Hosts (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the status of the virtualization hosts in a Nutanix cluster.
 The desired host state can be configured through wato.

 The hypervisor state (WARN if not ACROPOLIS_NORMAL, e.g. maintenance or HA
 failover), the node maintenance state and the maintenance mode of the CVM
 are checked as well.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

item:
 The name of the host.

discovery:
 One service is created for each host.
